TITLE:: RCMidi
summary:: MIDI CC control of a song, with 14-bit fine pairing
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCSong, Classes/RCKeyboardState

DESCRIPTION::
The proto-library's code::control_synth:: / code::control_midi:: / code::control_attribute::. Every MIDIdef made here is remembered by name and freed by link::#-free:: / link::#-freeAll::. code::fine: true:: pairs cc with cc + 32 (LSB).

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: findSrcId
uid of a MIDI source by name; nil with a warning when absent (the mapping then listens to all sources).

INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: control
argument:: name
argument:: ccNum
argument:: chan
argument:: deviceName
argument:: valFunc
Maps the raw value (0..127, fractional with fine).
argument:: action
Receives code::(value, raw)::.
argument:: fine
METHOD:: controlSynth
argument:: synth
argument:: attr
nil sets the value itself (buses).
argument:: setNothing
METHOD:: controlAttribute
code::object[key] = value:: for dictionaries, code::object.key_(value):: otherwise.
METHOD:: free
argument:: name
METHOD:: freeAll
